# Plan balances widget (right-hand sidebar). Copy this file to `.env` in this same folder
# (the Agent Office code folder) and fill in what you have. `.env` is gitignored.
#
# The office reads this file on every balance refresh — no restart needed; click the widget's ↻.
# It is read privately by the widget only and is NOT added to the environment workers inherit,
# so an ANTHROPIC_API_KEY here never moves Claude Code workers off your subscription.
#
# Instead of this file you can click a provider in the widget and paste a key there; that copy is
# saved in the office's data folder (<office folder>/.agent-office/balances.json), not in git.

# Grok / xAI — the only provider with a real "credit left" API.
# Management key: console.x.ai -> Settings -> Management Keys.
XAI_MANAGEMENT_KEY=
# Team id (from the console URL). Optional when XAI_API_KEY is set: it is looked up from that key.
XAI_TEAM_ID=
XAI_API_KEY=

# OpenAI — no balance API exists; an Admin key shows what you spent this month.
# platform.openai.com/settings/organization/admin-keys (starts with sk-admin-)
OPENAI_ADMIN_KEY=

# Anthropic API — no balance API exists; an Admin key shows what you spent this month.
# console.anthropic.com/settings/admin-keys (starts with sk-ant-admin)
ANTHROPIC_ADMIN_KEY=
